flowchart TD
    POLL[ESME poll thread] --> ESME[For each bound ESME]
    ESME --> PDU[get_stored_pdu]
    PDU --> PDUT[(smpp_queued_pdu:system_id)]
    PDUT -->|LPOP| DELIVER1[Deliver PDU]

    ESME --> DLR[get_dlrs]
    DLR --> DLRT[(smpp_dlr:service)]
    DLRT -->|LPOP| DELIVER2[Build DLR PDU]

    ESME --> MO[get_stored report_mo]
    MO --> STORET[(smpp_store:queue)]
    STORET -->|LPOP + filter| DELIVER3[Deliver MO]

    FAIL{Temporary failure?}
    DELIVER1 --> FAIL
    DELIVER2 --> FAIL
    DELIVER3 --> FAIL
    FAIL -->|yes| RPUSH[LPUSH back to list]
    FAIL -->|no| ACK[remove / processed]
